<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Security/catalogType> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Specifies the exploit catalog type."@en .
<https://spdx.org/rdf/3.1/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/device> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Element refers to a chipset, processor, or electronic board."@en .
